source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-22
observed: A backslash-escaped bracket is literal text in Jira, so no link forms and jiro stays silent.
-- input.jira --
{{\[x]}}
-- rendered.html --
<p><tt>[x]</tt></p>
-- want.md --
`[x]`
-- warnings.json --
[]
